{"id":"vod_sn_36187","vodId":"36187","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"从零开始的魔法书","name_cn":"从零开始的魔法书","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/69e67b041c2c86c6164652c7bd1d9387.jpg"},"summary":"教会历526年——。世界上有魔女存在，“魔术”也得到普及。然而，世界还并未知晓“魔法”的存在。在这样的时代里，还有着被人们蔑称为“堕兽人”的半人半兽的佣兵。他就这样每日被魔女觊觎着，还梦想着能成为人类，直到某天在森林中遇到的美丽魔女改变了他的命运。“——想变回人类吗？那么佣兵，成为吾辈的护卫吧！”自称为零的魔女说自己的【零之书】——一本一旦使用不当甚至可能毁灭世界的魔法书不知被谁盗走，现正在寻找这本书的旅途中。佣兵以零使用力量帮助他成为人类为条件，接受了成为自己最讨厌的魔女的护卫的要求。围绕着禁断的魔法书，人们的思绪开始纷乱交错……。　　高贵的魔女与温柔的兽人所带来的极上幻想剧。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cdzJTg6s3L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yk329hXRrT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xiDKzd2jqY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uEVQbmYmpL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5xytayLNHh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yDD6TFzXgQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6201V23Hr51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JMMcp9MM531/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/S0Lk2pk59P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z7hVmtE7PM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SxJJa3kx5E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/p3KZ64vKQV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.687Z"}